{"pageid":955,"title":"Jer Junkman","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Jer Junkman</span>","revid":20772,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default type-wood\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Jer Junkman</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/9/9a/Jer_Junkman_Tranparent_BG.png/revision/latest?cb=20240311105334\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Jer Junkman Tranparent BG\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/9/9a/Jer_Junkman_Tranparent_BG.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20240311105334\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/9/9a/Jer_Junkman_Tranparent_BG.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20240311105334 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/9/9a/Jer_Junkman_Tranparent_BG.png/revision/latest?cb=20240311105334 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Jer Junkman Tranparent BG\" width=\"270\" height=\"270\" data-image-key=\"Jer_Junkman_Tranparent_BG.png\" data-image-name=\"Jer Junkman Tranparent BG.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStats\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Finlay_Island\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Finlay Island\">Finlay Island</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Building\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Building</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Resource_Hub\" title=\"Resource Hub\">Resource Hub</a></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">?</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p><b>Jer Junkman</b> is an NPC who buys resources from players in the <a href=\"/wiki/Resource_Hub\" title=\"Resource Hub\">Resource Hub</a>. Prior to the map update, he operated in <a href=\"/wiki/Jer%27s_Junkyard\" title=\"Jer&#39;s Junkyard\">his junkyard</a>. Selling goods via Jer Junkman has a 5% value reduction compared to selling in the furnace.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearance\">Appearance</span></h2>\n<p>Jer Junkman sports a short white beard and hair that is bald in the middle. He wears no shirt, only a brown work overall, he has brown shoes with white accents.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Dialogue\">Dialogue</span></h2>\n<p>\"Sell your materials here!\" - interaction prompt\n</p><p>When no resources are brought to the Resource Hub:\n</p>\n<ul><li>\"Hey there! I heard you might have some goods for me. Bring me any types of materials such as stone or wood and i will give you a hefty sum of cash!\"\n<ul><li>Okay! (Ends conversation)</li></ul></li></ul>\n<p>When you bring resources to the Resource Hub:\n</p>\n<ul><li>\"Are you sure you would like to sell me all these precious goods for [Total_Price]?\"\n<ul><li>Yes please. (Sells your materials and gain money)</li>\n<li>Heck no! (Ends conversation)</li></ul></li></ul>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible\" style=\"background:#291F1D; width:100%; padding:.1em; margin:.5em auto; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\" data-expandtext=\"Open\" data-collapsetext=\"Close\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:105px; background:#140401; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\"><span style=\"float:left; padding-left:10px; padding-top:4px; font-size:90%\"><a href=\"/wiki/Template:NPC_Nav\" title=\"Template:NPC Nav\"><span title=\"View this template\">v</span></a> • <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Template_talk:NPC_Nav\"><span title=\"Discuss this template\">d</span></a> • <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Template:NPC_Nav?action=edit\"><span title=\"Edit this template\">e</span></a></span><figure class=\"mw-halign-center\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Oaklands\" title=\"Oaklands Wiki\"><img alt=\"Oaklands Wiki\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/e/e6/Site-logo.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/115?cb=20221025233312\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"115\" height=\"31\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Site-logo.png\" data-image-key=\"Site-logo.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a><figcaption>Oaklands Wiki</figcaption></figure>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:0; margin:0\">\n<table class=\"navbox\" style=\"border-radius